 dock widget registered into the conversation composer's dock slot, with the
-braid's tooltip/flash copy shipped as a plugin locale namespace. Written in
-the 0.1.1-era style. The host is moving to dsh 0.1.2-alpha.2.
+braid's tooltip/flash copy shipped as a plugin locale namespace. Migrated from
+the 0.1.1-era cohort to dsh 0.1.2-alpha.2: the browser half ships as the
+package's `./client` lazy CJS factory bundle, `ctx.slots` is provided by
+`@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-renderer`, and `ctx.locale` by
+`@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale`.
 
 Release procedure (internal):
 
